# Keep shell scripts LF-only: a Windows checkout with autocrlf would corrupt
# them (Git Bash executes CRLF scripts only via bash's lenient mode, and the
# shebang line breaks under some invocations). CRLF in *data* (jq output) is
# handled at runtime; this protects the scripts themselves.
*.sh text eol=lf
hooks.json text eol=lf
